       "text": "This is an **exceptionally strong offer**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 43,
       "endIndex": 216,
       "text": "It sits at the top end (90th+ percentile) of Google\u2019s L6 Product Management compensation band and represents a significant financial upgrade over your current Meta package"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 257,
       "endIndex": 360,
       "text": "To evaluate this accurately, it is essential to understand **Google\u2019s front-loaded vesting schedule**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 364,
       "endIndex": 544,
       "text": "Unlike Meta (which typically vests RSUs evenly at 25% per year), Google\u2019s standard 4-year new-hire equity vests **33% in Year 1, 33% in Year 2, 22% in Year 3, and 12% in Year 4**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 846,
       "endIndex": 905,
       "text": "| **RSUs (Stock)** | $200,000\u2013$250,000 | $442,200 *(33%)*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 846,
       "endIndex": 924,
       "text": "| **RSUs (Stock)** | $200,000\u2013$250,000 | $442,200 *(33%)* | $442,200 *(33%)*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1367,
       "endIndex": 1479,
       "text": "**The \"Year 3 & 4 Cliff\":** In Year 3, your initial grant drops to 22% ($294.8k), and in Year 4 to 12% ($160.8k)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       4
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1481,
       "endIndex": 1608,
       "text": "Google designs it this way expecting annual equity refreshers (which vest evenly at 25%/year) to stack on top and fill that gap"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       5
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1612,
       "endIndex": 1712,
       "text": "**Market Benchmarks:** A typical Google L6 PM total compensation averages **$500,000\u2013$600,000/yr**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       1
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1714,
       "endIndex": 1863,
       "text": "At **$1.34M in RSUs + $200k sign-on**, your offer is already at the top of the band (often reserved for high-priority hires or strong counter-offers)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0,
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3059,
       "endIndex": 3131,
       "text": "**The context:** $200k is already high for L6 (standard is $50k\u2013$100k)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 4030,
       "endIndex": 4240,
       "text": "If they hold firm and say this is their \"best and final,\" **you should still accept it**\u2014the Year 1\u20132 upside ($1.7M+ total across two years) is difficult to beat at the L6/IC6 level anywhere in the Bay Area"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       3,
       0,
       1
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
